<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Under His wings—what a refuge in sorrow!</l><l>How the heart yearningly turns to His rest!</l><l>Often when earth has no balm for my healing,</l><l>There I find comfort, and there I am blest.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Under His wings—oh, what precious enjoyment!</l><l>There will I hide till life’s trials are o’er;</l><l>Sheltered, protected, no evil can harm me;</l><l>Resting in Jesus I’m safe evermore.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
